msgstr "Commérages"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6318
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:8113
msgctxt "doomsday-comms"
msgid "Tell me about Gregory Unruh"
msgstr "Parlez-nous de Gregory Unruh"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6323
msgctxt "doomsday-comms"
msgid "He's a retired scientist here. He's on C deck if you'd like to visit"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, c'est un scientifique à la retraite ici.\n"
"Ses quartiers se trouvent sur le pont C si vous souhaitez le rencontrer."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6327
msgctxt "doomsday-comms"
msgid "Visit Gregory Unruh on C deck"
msgstr "Rendre visite à Gregory Unruh sur le pont C"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6332
msgctxt "doomsday-comms"
msgid "[Gregory Unruh] What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"...Quelqu'un vous ouvre la porte et après avoir observé vos uniformes, "
"s'adresse à vous avec un regard désagréable.\n"
"\n"
"[Gregory Unruh]\n"
"Bonjour. Que puis-je pour vous ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6338
msgctxt "doomsday-comms"
msgid "We need your plans for a doomsday device defense mechanism"
msgstr ""
"Il nous faut vos plans de défense contre une arme apocalyptique Éxuarie"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6344
msgctxt "doomsday-comms"
msgid ""
"Ah, I see someone is taking my research seriously. Here is my incomplete "
"prototype along with the plans. You'll notice that certain components are "
"still required."
msgstr ""
"[Gregory Unruh]\n"
"Ah, maintenant vous me prenez au sérieux après m'avoir fichu dehors ?\n"
"Je n'ai pas le temps d'être rancunier vu l'urgence de la situation. Voici "
"mon prototype incomplet accompagné des plans. Vous remarquerez que certains "
"composants sont encore requis."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6360
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:8139
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Tell me about Morrigan Thultris"
msgstr "Parlez-nous de Morrigan Thultris"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6363
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "She does medical research here"
msgstr ""
"Le Dr Thultris ?\n"
"Elle fait des recherches médicales ici."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6366
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "May I speak with her?"
msgstr "Pouvons-nous lui parler ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6371
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"She won't come to the communications nexus, but you may visit her in her "
"quarters"
msgstr ""
"Elle ne viendra pas au poste de communication, mais vous pouvez lui rendre "
"visite dans ses quartiers."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6375
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Visit Dr. Thultris"
msgstr "Aller chez le Dr Thultris"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6380
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"Who is it?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris derrière la porte fermée de ses quartiers]\n"
"Oui, c'est pour quoi ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6387
#, lua-format
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "I am an officer from the Human Navy ship, %s"
msgstr "Bonjour, je suis officier sur le vaisseau %s de la Marine humaine"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6395
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris toujours derrière sa porte fermée]\n"
"Que me voulez-vous ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6401
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "We need your help"
msgstr "Nous avons besoin de votre aide"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6412
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris opens her door]\n"
"With what?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris ouvre sa porte]\n"
"A quel sujet ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6418
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6684
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6835
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6968
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7101
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Grab Dr. Thultris"
msgstr "Saisir le Dr Thultris de force"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6428
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6561
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6694
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6845
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6978
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7111
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"As you pull her down the corridor back to the ship, explaining why you've "
"come for her, she protests initially then eventually runs back with you, "
"convinced of the urgency of the situation"
msgstr ""
"...Alors que vous la tirez dans le couloir jusqu'au vaisseau, lui expliquant "
"pourquoi vous êtes venu la chercher, elle proteste d'abord puis vient "
"finalement avec vous, convaincue de l'urgence de la situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6439
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6572
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6705
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6856
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6989
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7122
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "She slams the door in your face as you reach for her"
msgstr ""
"...Elle vous claque la porte au nez alors que vous essayez de l'attraper."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6450
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "A dying patient needs your expertise"
msgstr "Un patient mourant a besoin de votre expertise"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6464
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] Then let's get going to help the patient\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"Alors dépêchons-nous d'aller voir ce patient.\n"
"\n"
"...En revenant tous les deux au vaisseau, vous lui expliquez la situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6475
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"People die all the time\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Des gens meurent tout le temps.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris vous claque sa porte au nez]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6486
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "An Arlenian Admiral shows symptoms like those you published"
msgstr ""
"Un Arlénien présente des symptômes similaires à ceux que vous avez publié"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6500
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] Take me to the admiral\n"
"\n"
"As you both return to the ship, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"Emmenez-moi le voir.\n"
"\n"
"...Lorsque vous retournez tous les deux au vaisseau, vous lui expliquez la "
"situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6511
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"An Arlenian Admiral? Who cares!\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Un Arlénien ? Qui s'en soucie !\n"
"[Dr. Thultris referme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6523
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"Go away, I'm busy"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris à travers la porte]\n"
"Allez-vous en, je suis occupé."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6534
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Medical team suggested your research for a patient"
msgstr "L'équipe médicale a cité vos recherches pour un patient très malade"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6545
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris opens her door]\n"
"How does my research apply to a patient?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris ouvre sa porte]\n"
"En quoi mes recherches ont-elles à voir avec ce patient ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6551
msgctxt "Doctor-comms"
msgid "Grab Dr. Thultris"
msgstr "Saisir le Dr Thultris"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6583
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "The symptoms closely correlate to your research"
msgstr "Ses symptômes sont étroitement liés à vos recherches"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6597
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] I think I can help\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"Je pense que je peux vous aider.\n"
"\n"
"...Lorsque vous revenez tous les deux au vaisseau, vous lui expliquez la "
"situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6608
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"Let me know what happens with the patient\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Vous n'aurez qu'à me donner de ses nouvelles.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris ferme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6619
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Your research may save an Arlenian Admiral's life"
msgstr "Vos recherches peuvent sauver la vie d'un amiral Arlénien"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6633
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] I would love to apply my research\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"C'est l'occasion de mettre en pratique mes recherches.\n"
"\n"
"...Lorsque vous revenez tous les deux au vaisseau, vous lui expliquez la "
"situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6644
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"Diplomacy and military matters bore me\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"La diplomatie et les affaires militaires m'ennuient. Bonne chance à vous.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris referme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6656
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"That's nice. Leave me alone"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris à travers la porte]\n"
"C'est bien. Laissez-moi tranquille."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6667
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Arlenian with an unusual disease is near death"
msgstr ""
"Un Arlénien est atteint d'une maladie inhabituelle et est proche de la mort"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6678
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris opens her door]\n"
"Why come to me?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris ouvre sa porte]\n"
"Pourquoi venir me voir moi ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6716
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "The Arlenian medical team referred us to you"
msgstr "L'équipe médicale Arlénienne nous a envoyé vers vous"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6730
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] Nice to be recognized outside of human space\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"C'est toujours agréable d'être reconnue en dehors de l'espace humain.\n"
"\n"
"...Lorsque vous revenez tous les deux au vaisseau, vous lui expliquez la "
"situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6741
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"What do the Arlenians know?\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce qu'ils connaissent de mes travaux ces Arléniens ?\n"
"[Dr. Thultris claque sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6752
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Your research accurately describes the symptoms"
msgstr "Vos recherches décrivent avec précision les symptômes"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6766
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] I would like to see the patient\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"Je voudrais voir le patient.\n"
"\n"
"...Lorsque vous revenez au vaisseau avec le docteur, vous lui expliquez la "
"situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6777
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"Coincidental, I'm sure\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Coïncidence, j'en suis sûr.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris vous claque sa porte au nez]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6789
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"My condolences. Goodbye"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris à travers la porte]\n"
"Mes condoléances. Au revoir."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6806
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "I am an admirer of your research and have questions"
msgstr "Je suis un admirateur de vos recherches et j'aurai des questions"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6812
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"Really? What is it about my research you admire?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris toujours derrière sa porte fermée]\n"
"Ah bon ? Et qu'est-ce que vous admirez dans mes recherches ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6818
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "The depth of your most recent publication"
msgstr "La profondeur de votre récente publication"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6829
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris opens her door]\n"
"Why does this research interest you?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris ouvre sa porte]\n"
"Pourquoi cette recherche vous intéresse-t-elle ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6867
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "I know of a patient that might benefit"
msgstr "Je connais un patient qui pourrait en bénéficier"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6881
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] Those are rare. May I see the patient?\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"C'est une maladie rare pourtant. Puis-je voir le patient ?\n"
"\n"
"...En revenant tous les deux au vaisseau, vous lui expliquez la situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6892
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"My research is unlikely to apply\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Ma recherche est peu susceptible de s'appliquer.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris ferme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6903
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Your research could help a sick Arlenian Admiral"
msgstr "Vos recherches pourraient aider un amiral Arlénien très malade"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6917
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] I would like to see my research in the Arlenian context\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"J'aimerais utiliser mes recherches dans le contexte Arlénien.\n"
"\n"
"...Le docteur vous suit jusqu'au vaisseau. Vous lui expliquez la situation "
"en chemin."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6928
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"I don't think it applies to Arlenians\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Je ne pense pas que cela puisse s'appliquer aux Arléniens. Je suis désolée.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris referme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6940
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"Publish a review and we'll talk"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris toujours derrière sa porte fermée]\n"
"Vous n'avez qu'à publier une critique et nous en reparlerons.\n"
"Au revoir."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6951
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "The breadth of knowledge you demonstrate"
msgstr "L'étendue des connaissances dont vous faites preuve"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:6962
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris opens her door]\n"
"I doubt that. Why are you *really* here?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris ouvre sa porte]\n"
"J'en doute. Pourquoi êtes-vous *vraiment* ici ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7000
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "We need your help with a dying Arlenian Admiral"
msgstr "Nous avons besoin de votre aide avec un amiral Arlénien mourant"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7014
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7147
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] Why didn't you say so? Of course I'll help\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"Pourquoi ne l'avez-vous pas dit plus tôt ? Bien sûr que je vais vous aider.\n"
"\n"
"...En revenant tous les deux au vaisseau, vous lui expliquez la situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7025
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"Your first story was better\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Votre premier mensonge était meilleur.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris claque sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7036
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "An Arlenian medical team thinks you can help a dying patient"
msgstr "Les médecins Arléniens pense que vous pouvez aider un patient mourant"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7050
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] That's reasonable. Let's go\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"Ca me semble faisable. Allons-y.\n"
"\n"
"...En revenant au vaisseau avec le docteur Thultris, vous lui expliquez la "
"situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7061
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"I'm not concerned with Arlenian patients\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Les patients Arléniens ne sont pas mon problème.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris referme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7073
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"Faint praise insults me. Go away"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris à travers la porte de ses quartiers]\n"
"Vos compliments hypocrites sont une insulte à mon intelligence. Allez-vous-"
"en."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7084
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Your superb publication presentation"
msgstr "Votre superbe présentation de publication"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7095
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris opens her door]\n"
"Ha! Is that why you're here?"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris ouvre sa porte]\n"
"Ha ! C'est pour ça que vous êtes là ?"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7133
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Not really. We need your help"
msgstr "En fait...Pas vraiment. Nous avons besoin de votre aide"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7158
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I'm too busy right now\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Je suis désolé, mais je suis trop occupée en ce moment.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris referme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7169
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Of course! I've got a case study for you to examine"
msgstr "Bien sûr ! J'ai un cas d'école pour vous à étudier"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7183
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] An application for my research?! Goody Goody!\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris]\n"
"Une application pour mes recherches ?! Bien, bien !\n"
"\n"
"...En rejoignant le vaisseau avec le docteur, vous lui expliquez la "
"situation."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7194
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"Sounds interesting, but not right now, thanks\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""
"Cela semble intéressant, mais pas pour le moment, merci.\n"
"[Dr. Thultris referme sa porte]"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7206
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"Get a writing advisor and get out of here"
msgstr ""
"[Dr. Thultris à travers la porte de ses quartiers]\n"
"Dans ce cas, prenez un conseiller en rédaction et partez d'ici."

