msgstr ""
"l'amiral Arlénien Koshenz vient de mourir avec le reste des Arléniens sur la "
"station %s."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:11116
msgctxt "doctor-shipLog"
msgid ""
"The Arlenians say that they think the admiral has less than three minutes to "
"live"
msgstr ""
"[Message du QG] Les Arléniens disent qu'ils pensent que l'amiral a moins de "
"3 minutes à vivre."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:11145
#, lua-format
msgctxt "doctor-shipLog"
msgid ""
"The Kraylors seem to have discovered the location of Admiral Koshenz. We "
